{"id":"sour-grapes","title":"Sour Grapes","author":"William Carlos Williams","year":"1921","note":"Post–Spring and All bitterness — hospital corridors, backyard fruit, hard American speech.","minutes":157,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Chapter 1","place":"Chapter 1","reentry":"THE LATE SINGER","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s1","title":"Chapter I","place":"Chapter I","reentry":"I","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s2","title":"Chapter II","place":"Chapter II","reentry":"II","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s3","title":"Chapter III","place":"Chapter III","reentry":"III","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s4","title":"Chapter IV","place":"Chapter IV","reentry":"IV","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"THE LATE SINGER"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"Here it is spring again"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"and I still a young man!"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"I am late at my singing."},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"The sparrow with the black rain on his breast"},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"has been at his cadenzas for two weeks past:"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"What is it that is dragging at my heart?"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"The grass by the back door"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"is stiff with sap."},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"The old maples are opening"},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"their branches of brown and yellow moth-flowers."},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"A moon hangs in the blue"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"in the early afternoons over the marshes."},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"I am late at my singing."},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"MARCH"},{"id":"s1-0","sceneId":"s1","text":"I"},{"id":"s1-1","sceneId":"s1","text":"Winter is long in this climate"},{"id":"s1-2","sceneId":"s1","text":"and spring--a matter of a few days"},{"id":"s1-3","sceneId":"s1","text":"only,--a flower or two picked"},{"id":"s1-4","sceneId":"s1","text":"from mud or from among wet leaves"},{"id":"s1-5","sceneId":"s1","text":"or at best against treacherous"},{"id":"s1-6","sceneId":"s1","text":"bitterness of wind, and sky shining"},{"id":"s1-7","sceneId":"s1","text":"teasingly, then closing in black"},{"id":"s1-8","sceneId":"s1","text":"and sudden, with fierce jaws."},{"id":"s2-0","sceneId":"s2","text":"II"},{"id":"s2-1","sceneId":"s2","text":"March,"},{"id":"s2-2","sceneId":"s2","text":"you remind me of"},{"id":"s2-3","sceneId":"s2","text":"the pyramids, our pyramids--"},{"id":"s2-4","sceneId":"s2","text":"stript of the polished stone"},{"id":"s2-5","sceneId":"s2","text":"that used to guard them!"},{"id":"s2-6","sceneId":"s2","text":"March,"},{"id":"s2-7","sceneId":"s2","text":"you are like Fra Angelico"},{"id":"s2-8","sceneId":"s2","text":"at Fiesole, painting on plaster!"},{"id":"s2-9","sceneId":"s2","text":"March,"},{"id":"s2-10","sceneId":"s2","text":"you are like a band of"},{"id":"s2-11","sceneId":"s2","text":"young poets that have not learned"},{"id":"s2-12","sceneId":"s2","text":"the blessedness of warmth"},{"id":"s2-13","sceneId":"s2","text":"(or have forgotten it)."},{"id":"s2-14","sceneId":"s2","text":"At any rate--"},{"id":"s2-15","sceneId":"s2","text":"I am moved to write poetry"},{"id":"s2-16","sceneId":"s2","text":"for the warmth there is in it"},{"id":"s2-17","sceneId":"s2","text":"and for the loneliness--"},{"id":"s2-18","sceneId":"s2","text":"a poem that shall have you"},{"id":"s2-19","sceneId":"s2","text":"in it March."},{"id":"s3-0","sceneId":"s3","text":"III"},{"id":"s3-1","sceneId":"s3","text":"See!"},{"id":"s3-2","sceneId":"s3","text":"Ashur-ban-i-pal,"},{"id":"s3-3","sceneId":"s3","text":"the archer king, on horse-back,"},{"id":"s3-4","sceneId":"s3","text":"in blue and yellow enamel!"},{"id":"s3-5","sceneId":"s3","text":"with drawn bow--facing lions"},{"id":"s3-6","sceneId":"s3","text":"standing on their hind legs,"},{"id":"s3-7","sceneId":"s3","text":"fangs bared! his shafts"},{"id":"s3-8","sceneId":"s3","text":"bristling in their necks!"},{"id":"s3-9","sceneId":"s3","text":"Sacred bulls--dragons"},{"id":"s3-10","sceneId":"s3","text":"in embossed brickwork"},{"id":"s3-11","sceneId":"s3","text":"marching--in four tiers--"},{"id":"s3-12","sceneId":"s3","text":"along the sacred way to"},{"id":"s3-13","sceneId":"s3","text":"Nebuchadnezzar's throne hall!"},{"id":"s3-14","sceneId":"s3","text":"They shine in the sun,"},{"id":"s3-15","sceneId":"s3","text":"they that have been marching--"},{"id":"s3-16","sceneId":"s3","text":"marching under the dust of"},{"id":"s3-17","sceneId":"s3","text":"ten thousand dirt years."},{"id":"s3-18","sceneId":"s3","text":"Now--"},{"id":"s3-19","sceneId":"s3","text":"they are coming into bloom again!"},{"id":"s3-20","sceneId":"s3","text":"See them!"},{"id":"s3-21","sceneId":"s3","text":"marching still, bared by"},{"id":"s3-22","sceneId":"s3","text":"the storms from my calendar"},{"id":"s3-23","sceneId":"s3","text":"--winds that blow back the sand!"},{"id":"s3-24","sceneId":"s3","text":"winds that enfilade dirt!"},{"id":"s3-25","sceneId":"s3","text":"winds that by strange craft"},{"id":"s3-26","sceneId":"s3","text":"have whipt up a black army"},{"id":"s3-27","sceneId":"s3","text":"that by pick and shovel"},{"id":"s3-28","sceneId":"s3","text":"bare a procession to"},{"id":"s3-29","sceneId":"s3","text":"the god, Marduk!"},{"id":"s3-30","sceneId":"s3","text":"Natives cursing and digging"},{"id":"s3-31","sceneId":"s3","text":"for pay unearth dragons with"},{"id":"s3-32","sceneId":"s3","text":"upright tails and sacred bulls"},{"id":"s3-33","sceneId":"s3","text":"alternately--"},{"id":"s3-34","sceneId":"s3","text":"in four tiers--"},{"id":"s3-35","sceneId":"s3","text":"lining the way to an old altar!"},{"id":"s3-36","sceneId":"s3","text":"Natives digging at old walls--"},{"id":"s3-37","sceneId":"s3","text":"digging me warmth--digging me"},{"id":"s3-38","sceneId":"s3","text":"sweet loneliness--"},{"id":"s3-39","sceneId":"s3","text":"high enamelled walls."},{"id":"s4-0","sceneId":"s4","text":"IV"},{"id":"s4-1","sceneId":"s4","text":"My second spring--"},{"id":"s4-2","sceneId":"s4","text":"passed in a monastery"},{"id":"s4-3","sceneId":"s4","text":"with plaster walls--in Fiesole"},{"id":"s4-4","sceneId":"s4","text":"on the hill above Florence."},{"id":"s4-5","sceneId":"s4","text":"My second spring--painted"},{"id":"s4-6","sceneId":"s4","text":"a virgin--in a blue aureole"},{"id":"s4-7","sceneId":"s4","text":"sitting on a three-legged stool,"},{"id":"s4-8","sceneId":"s4","text":"arms crossed--"},{"id":"s4-9","sceneId":"s4","text":"she is intently serious,"},{"id":"s4-10","sceneId":"s4","text":"and still"},{"id":"s4-11","sceneId":"s4","text":"watching an angel"}]}